# EAS Build project archive ignore rules.
#
# This MUST live at the git repository root, not inside mobile/ — EAS CLI
# only looks for .easignore (and, for its own archive-scoping, only reads
# .gitignore) at the repo root. This repo is a monorepo (mobile/ +
# pharma-stock/ under one .git), and the root .gitignore only excludes one
# Firebase file, so without this, EAS was silently packing mobile/node_modules
# (4.8 GB) and mobile/android (1.67 GB, a local dev-build byproduct — this is
# a CNG/managed-workflow project, native folders are never committed and are
# regenerated by prebuild during the cloud build) straight into the archive.
# Once this file exists, .gitignore is no longer consulted at all, so
# everything relevant is re-listed here explicitly, paths relative to repo
# root. https://docs.expo.dev/build-reference/easignore/

# --- mobile/ (the EAS project) ---
mobile/node_modules/
mobile/android/
mobile/ios/
mobile/.expo/
mobile/dist/
mobile/web-build/
mobile/.git/
mobile/.vscode/
mobile/.claude/
mobile/*.orig.*
mobile/*.jks
mobile/*.p8
mobile/*.p12
mobile/*.key
mobile/*.mobileprovision
mobile/*.pem
# Credentials not needed to build the app bundle itself (submit/backend only)
mobile/google-play-service-account.json
mobile/*-service-account.json
mobile/pharmastock-d0cb4-firebase-adminsdk-fbsvc-b875dfb8a1.json
mobile/.env*.local
mobile/*.tsbuildinfo
mobile/npm-debug.*
mobile/yarn-debug.*
mobile/yarn-error.*
mobile/.DS_Store
mobile/.metro-health-check*
mobile/*.zip

# --- pharma-stock/ (separate web app, not an EAS project — excluded for
#     hygiene in case this ignore file is ever read repo-wide) ---
pharma-stock/node_modules/
pharma-stock/.next/
pharma-stock/.git/
pharma-stock/.env*.local

# --- repo-wide ---
.git/
